# git for windows ships core.autocrlf=true in its system config, so a checkout hands out a crlf
# working tree while the blobs themselves are lf; that made every line of every file violate
# end_of_line = lf from the .editorconfig, locally and on the windows CI runner alike
# pinning eol=lf here changes no blob, it only makes the checkout match what is stored
* text=auto eol=lf
